ldsymbol{x}$?","options":["All $N$ inequalities must hold.","At least one of the inequalities must hold.","Nothing: all $N$ inequalities may be released together.","No $\\boldsymbol{x}$ is feasible, as no inequality is required."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"b46d93ff819476e087906952","time_limit":40,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"duplicate_diagnostic_target"},{"id":"year_1_1a_or_modelling_k_out_of_n_constraints_d265695a_007","difficulty":"basic","question_type":"application","question":"At least three of five constraints must hold. Each constraint $i$ is written as $\\boldsymbol{a}_i^{\\top}\\boldsymbol{x}\\le d_i+My_i$ with binary release indicator $y_i$ (1 = released) and a valid $M$. Which selector constraint is correct?","options":["$y_1+\\dots+y_5\\le2$","$y_1+\\dots+y_5\\le3$","$y_1+\\dots+y_5\\ge3$","$y_1+\\dots+y_5\\le5$"],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"5ea6c74a2ee6c56c566e8cf8","time_limit":30,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"duplicate_diagnostic_target"},{"id":"year_1_1a_or_modelling_k_out_of_n_constraints_d265695a_013","difficulty":"standard","question_type":"conceptual","question":"In the K-out-of-N formulation $\\boldsymbol{a}_i^{\\top}\\boldsymbol{x}\\le d_i+My_i$ ($i=1,\\dots,N$) with binary $y_i$, a constant $M$, and $\\sum_{i=1}^{N}y_i\\le N-K$, the chosen $M$ is smaller than needed for the variable bounds. What can go wrong?","options":["Points violating more than $N-K$ inequalities become feasible.","Nothing, since $M$ only needs to be positive.","Released inequalities still bind and cut off allowed points.","The selector constraint must then use $N$ instead of $N-K$."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"6426c68589c7ec7ae8164fe2","time_limit":40,"curation_status":"retired","retired_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:47.943104+00:00","reason_code":"duplicate_diagnostic_target"}]}}